OL,3,GNEWSACoroner criticises police over gun
OL,4,Alicence renewal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has criticised Devon and
OL,7,FCornwall Police for a lack of
OL,8,F"professional curiosity" after officers
OL,9,Frenewed a firearms licence for a man
OL,10,Fwho later shot his wife dead before
OL,11,Ftaking his own life.
OL,13,FAn inquest at Exeter Coroners Court
OL,14,Fheard that John Perkins, 66, shot
OL,15,FKathryn Perkins, 67, at their home in
OL,16,FBriar Close, Exmouth after she said she
OL,17,Fwas leaving him.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
