OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1794909353
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACoroner criticises police over gun
OL,4,Alicence renewal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily members said former Royal Marine
OL,7,FPerkins was violent and abusive towards
OL,8,Fhis wife. Area Coroner Alison Longhorn
OL,9,Fsaid domestic abuse may not have been
OL,10,Fconsidered as carefully as it could
OL,11,Fhave been in the gun licensing process.
OL,13,FLonghorn recorded Kathryn Perkins'
OL,14,Fdeath as an unlawful killing and John
OL,15,FPerkins' death as suicide.
